---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import ColorIdentifier from '../components/ColorIdentifier.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Image Color Picker — Pick HEX, RGB and HSL from a Photo" description="Pick a color from any image using a browser-based image color picker. Upload a photo, select a pixel and copy HEX, RGB or HSL values."><div class="container"><div class="page-hero"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Image Color Picker</div><span class="eyebrow">Pick a pixel from a picture</span><h1>Image Color Picker</h1><p>Upload an image and select any visible pixel to get its HEX, RGB and HSL color values. Images stay in your browser during processing.</p></div><ColorIdentifier/><div class="content-layout"><article class="prose"><h2>Pick a color from an image</h2><p>Use the upload control to choose a PNG, JPEG, WebP or other browser-supported image. Once the image is displayed, click or tap the exact point you want to inspect.</p><h2>Supported color values</h2><p>The picker returns HEX for web design, RGB for screen color channels and HSL for hue, saturation and lightness. The values describe the pixel as represented in the image file; they do not correct for the lighting or camera profile used to create it.</p><h2>Related tools</h2><ul><li><a href="/color-identifier/">Camera color identifier</a></li><li><a href="/hex-to-rgb/">HEX to RGB converter</a></li><li><a href="/color-name-finder/">Color name finder</a></li></ul></article></div></div></BaseLayout>
